# No Spec, No Start

A User Story may move to **In Progress** only when it meets the Definition of Ready (DoR):

1. Clear functional description
2. Explicit acceptance criteria
3. UX/UI designs linked when UI work is in scope
4. Linked to a parent Feature or Epic in Azure DevOps

If DoR is incomplete, refine first — do not start coding.
